diff --git a/Changelog.txt b/Changelog.txt
index 1db9501..7729815 100644
--- a/Changelog.txt
+++ b/Changelog.txt
@@ -1,3 +1,9 @@
+Version 2.3.003-WRV-XP-2
+    Changed the XP bonus indicator to appear only after positive accepted XP gains and hide after three seconds by default
+    Added General.XP_Bonus_Indicator.Display_Seconds; repeated gains refresh the brief display without duplicating bars
+    Preserved hidden preferences; joining, movement and show/status commands no longer create a persistent bar
+    Ignored cancelled, zero and rejected awards and cleared notifications on world change, quit and shutdown
+
 Version 2.3.003-WRV-XP-1
     Added a source-guarded Paper green-bar XP bonus that stacks the Together multiplier with the WeekendXP event rate
     Preserved fractional green-bar bonuses across pickups and reconnects instead of rounding every small orb down
